ts. Good general knowledge of building construction and repair. Physical examination required. Must be able to perform physical requirements related to specific position. Some evening and weekend work may be required. Scheduled Hours Weekly: 37.5 Budgeted Wage for this Position: The budgeted compensation for this position is $20.29 per hour, plus $2.50/hour differential for Master electrician or plumbers. Exempt Status: Non-Exempt Grade: S12 Job Posting Responsibilities: Unit Determination: VSC Staff Federation - Vermont State Employees Association"
